# Both references count as uses of implied qualities.
define the potential position<my.domain.com:my_lib:/target>.
define the potential position<my.domain.com:my_lib:/source>.
define the potential action<my.domain.com:my_lib:/test> {
    it also assigns the position</target>.
    it also assigns the position</source>.
    it happens when {
        this particle is created.
    } and it does {
        set the value of position</target> to position</source>.
    }
}
